scoped app · &lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt; cache, rate limits, pub/sub between tasks · &lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt; slow work queued · &lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt; schedules · &lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt; worker · &lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt; CSV exports · &lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt; email · &lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt; files never pass through the API · &lt;b&gt;13&lt;/b&gt; deploy with short-lived credentials" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1120" width="2080" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
